---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | Mundesha Investments';
const description =
  'How Mundesha Investment One CC collects, uses and protects your personal information when you request a quote through this website.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} path="/privacy-policy">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>PRIVACY POLICY</h1>
      <p class="lead">Plain language, because your information deserves respect, not fine print.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Mundesha Investment One CC, trading as Mundesha Investments, is a close corporation based in
        Windhoek, Namibia. We provide air conditioning, refrigeration, electrical and related trade
        services across the country. This policy explains what happens to the information you give us
        through this website.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you request a quote we ask for your name, phone number, the service you need, your town
        and a short message. We collect nothing else through this site. We do not run advertising
        trackers, and we do not use analytics cookies that follow you around the internet. Our hosting
        provider keeps standard technical logs for security and uptime.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your details for one purpose: to prepare and deliver your quote, and to contact you
        about the work you asked about. We may contact you by phone, WhatsApp or email using the
        details you provided. Once a request is handled, we keep the record only as long as needed for
        our business administration and any legal obligations.
      </p>

      <h2>Who sees it</h2>
      <p>
        Only our own team, and the service providers that keep this website running, such as our
        hosting and email providers. We do not sell or rent your information, and we do not share it
        with marketers.
      </p>

      <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
      <p>
        Quote requests are processed by our website's server and delivered to our email inbox. Email
        and server storage may sit outside Namibia, so your information may be processed in other
        countries under the safeguards those providers apply.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You may ask us at any time to confirm what we hold about you, to correct it, or to delete it.
        Email us at info@mundesha.com or call +264 81 277 7553 and we will sort it out. If you
        would rather not use the form at all, you are welcome to phone or WhatsApp us directly.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If we change this policy, the updated version will appear on this page with a new effective
        date. This policy applies from 1 October 2026 and follows Namibian law.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
